        },
        {
          "text": "Bamthatha u-Abisalomu, bamphonsa emgodini omkhulu ehlathini, babeka phezu kwakhe inqwaba enkulu kakhulu yamatshe; wonke u-Israyeli wabaleka, kwaba yilowo nalowo waya etendeni lakhe.",
          "type": "text",
