              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Abisalomu wathatha insika esaphila, wazimisela yona esigodini senkosi; ngoba wathi: Kangilandodana yokukhumbula ibizo lami; wabiza insika ngegama lakhe; khala kuze kube namuhla, indawo ka-Abisalomu.",
          "type": "text",
