              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJowabe wasesithi kuye: Kawuyikuletha umbiko lamuhla, kodwa uzaletha ilizwi ngolunye usuku; kodwa namuhla aniyikuletha zwi, ngokuba indodana yenkosi ifile.",
