              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJowabe wasesithi kuKushi: Hamba uyetshela inkosi okubonileyo. UmKushi wakhothama phambi kukaJowabe, wagijima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
