              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Ahimayewu indodana kaSadoki wabuye wathi kuJowabe: “Kepha nami mangigijime ngilandele umKushi.” Wayesethi uJowabe: “Ugijimelani, ndodana yami, lokhu ungazi na?",
          "type": "text",
