              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa noma kunjalo, wathi, ake ngigijime. Wathi kuye: “Gijima.” Khona-ke u-Ahimaäs wagijima wehla ngomgwaqo esuka ethafeni futhi wamfica uKusi.",
          "type": "text",
