          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavide wahlala phansi phakathi kwamasango omabili, umlindi wakhwela ophahleni lwesango odongeni, waphakamisa amehlo akhe, wabheka, nanko umuntu egijima yedwa.",
          "type": "text",
