              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umlindi wabona enye indoda igijima; umlindi wabiza umlindisango, wathi: “Bheka, nanso indoda igijima iyodwa.” Yathi inkosi: “Naye uletha izindaba.”",
          "type": "text",
