              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Ahimayo wamemeza wathi enkosini: “Kulungile; Wawa ngobuso bakhe emhlabathini phambi kwenkosi, wathi: “Makabongwe uJehova uNkulunkulu wakho owakhulula abantu abaphakamisela isandla sabo enkosini yami, inkosi.",
