              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yathi: “Ingabe insizwa u-Abisalomu iphephile na?” U-Ahimaewu wathi: “Lapho uJowabe ethuma inceku yenkosi kanye nami, inceku yakho, ngabona isiyaluyalu esikhulu, kodwa angazi ukuthi kuyini.",
          "type": "text",
