              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka, kwafika uKusi; uKushi wathi: “Thumela, nkosi yami, nkosi, ngokuba uJehova ukuphindisele namuhla kubo bonke abakuvukelayo.",
          "type": "text",
