              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yathi kuKushi: “Ingabe insizwa u-Abisalomu iphephile na?” UKusi waphendula wathi: “Izitha zenkosi yami, inkosi, nabo bonke abakuvukelayo ukukulimaza, makube njengaleyo nsizwa;",
