        {
          "text": "Inkosi yathukuthela kakhulu, yakhuphukela ekamelweni elibhekene nesango, yakhala; wahamba, wathi: “Ndodana yami Abisalomu, ndodana yami, ndodana yami Abisalomu! Sengathi ngafela wena, Abisalomu, ndodana yami, ndodana yami!",
